    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259370/extras/1f27e21c46caaea89869367d3f7f0c0a.poster.avif?t=1605464193\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259370/extras/1f27e21c46caaea89869367d3f7f0c0a.webm?t=1605464193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259370/extras/1f27e21c46caaea89869367d3f7f0c0a.mp4?t=1605464193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Worm Jazz is a wriggly puzzler with a unique blend of game mechanics inspired by familiar classics such as Snake \ud83d\udc0d and Bomberman \ud83d\udca3. You take control of Mr. Mark, an earthworm with a particular fondness for smooth jazz and dapper headwear. Wiggle your way through intricate, mind-bending mazes filled with mines, wormholes and powerups! Are you able to gobble up all the food on each stage and reach the golden apple? \ud83c\udf4e<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Over <strong>50</strong> challenging scenarios set in different environments<br></li><li> Discover and unlock many unique hats \ud83c\udfa9<br></li><li> Smooth jazz \ud83c\udfb7<br></li><li> Play at your own pace; no timers and unlimited undo</li></ul><br>Worm Jazz won the grand prize at &quot;NM i Gameplay 2020&quot; (The Norwegian Gameplay Championships). The theme of the competition was &quot;extra life&quot;.<br><br>Join our community of puzzlers on Discord! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259370/extras/cf55791227748e82409fd3daea4bac06.poster.avif?t=1605464193\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259370/extras/cf55791227748e82409fd3daea4bac06.webm?t=1605464193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259370/extras/cf55791227748e82409fd3daea4bac06.mp4?t=1605464193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259370/extras/1f27e21c46caaea89869367d3f7f0c0a.poster.avif?t=1605464193\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259370/extras/1f27e21c46caaea89869367d3f7f0c0a.webm?t=1605464193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259370/extras/1f27e21c46caaea89869367d3f7f0c0a.mp4?t=1605464193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Worm Jazz is a wriggly puzzler with a unique blend of game mechanics inspired by familiar classics such as Snake \ud83d\udc0d and Bomberman \ud83d\udca3. You take control of Mr. Mark, an earthworm with a particular fondness for smooth jazz and dapper headwear. Wiggle your way through intricate, mind-bending mazes filled with mines, wormholes and powerups! Are you able to gobble up all the food on each stage and reach the golden apple? \ud83c\udf4e<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Over <strong>50</strong> challenging scenarios set in different environments<br></li><li> Discover and unlock many unique hats \ud83c\udfa9<br></li><li> Smooth jazz \ud83c\udfb7<br></li><li> Play at your own pace; no timers and unlimited undo</li></ul><br>Worm Jazz won the grand prize at &quot;NM i Gameplay 2020&quot; (The Norwegian Gameplay Championships). The theme of the competition was &quot;extra life&quot;.<br><br>Join our community of puzzlers on Discord! <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259370/extras/cf55791227748e82409fd3daea4bac06.poster.avif?t=1605464193\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259370/extras/cf55791227748e82409fd3daea4bac06.webm?t=1605464193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1259370/extras/cf55791227748e82409fd3daea4bac06.mp4?t=1605464193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Worm Jazz is a wriggly puzzler with a unique blend of game mechanics inspired by familiar classics such as Snake and Bomberman. Features smooth jazz, explosive chain-reactions and dapper headwear.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Norwegian",
    "reviews": "\u201cWorm Jazz is one of the best puzzlers I\u2019ve played in a long while. It\u2019s intelligent, smooth, stars a hat-wearing worm and features a chilled jazz soundtrack. Nice.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 The Sixth Axis<br><br>\u201cWorm Jazz is a simple puzzle game with a laid back Jazz attitude, perfect for engaging your brain with as little added stress as possible.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 God is a Geek<br><br>\u201cWorm Jazz is a clever puzzle game that can get challenging as you work your way through the levels, but it\u2019s so forgiving that it mainly just wants you to sit back, relax and listen to some smooth jazz.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 GameGrin<br>",
